<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 800s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 9th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 800s, 467 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 175 were founded and 96 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Abbasid Caliphate, the Byzantine Empire and the Tang Dynasty.</p></header>
